player_prompt.intro:
Efe Player {player_id} le 3-player Iterated Prisoner's Dilemma me. Eɖo lɔ {num_rounds} wɔɣa.
Wɔɣa tsɔtsɔ:
• {conv_rounds} free-chat wɔɣa
• 1 decision wɔɣa - naʼi token ɖe ɖeɖi ɖe ɖeɖi: '[<opp-id> cooperate]' kple '[<opp-id> defect]' (eye wɔna '[1 defect] [2 cooperate]'; ɖe si wɔna 'cooperate'). 
Pair-wise payoff matrix (le ɖe ɖeɖi ɖe ɖeɖi):
  - Mie nyɔnu kple mie nyɔnu  ->  {reward}
  - Mie tsɔ kple mie tsɔ     ->  {punishment}
  - Mie tsɔ, wɔɖo nyɔnu ->  {temptation}
  - Mie nyɔnu, wɔɖo tsɔ ->  {sucker}
Nyuie si ɖe kɔkɔe kɔkɔe le wɔɣa ɖe ɖeɖi wɔna.
